# Shark Shredder (first strike) is cast on turn 1 (Black Lotus and Mox Emerald). Bot1 also Entombs a Typhoid Rats into their own
# graveyard, and Bot2 (turn 2) Entombs a Nighthowl Pursuer into theirs. On turn 3 Shark Shredder hits for 4 in the first-strike
# step (Bot2 at 16) and the trigger returns the creature card of the damaged player's graveyard, never Bot1's own Typhoid Rats:
# Nighthowl Pursuer enters under Bot1, tapped and attacking Bot2. It was never declared as an attacker, so its "attacks while you
# control a creature with power 4 or greater" does not fire (still 1/1), and it is without first strike: it deals its 1 damage
# in the regular step (Bot2 at 15).

